{
 "duration": 26.542,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Dan planned a treat at the top.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 1.74
  },
  {
   "text": "Three cold hours, nothing to eat.",
   "start": 1.94,
   "end": 4.029
  },
  {
   "text": "Halfway up he was shivering and slow, even in his warm layers.",
   "start": 4.329,
   "end": 7.931
  },
  {
   "text": "His body had nothing left to burn.",
   "start": 8.131,
   "end": 10.005
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. In the cold, eat a small snack about every hour, before you feel hungry.",
   "start": 10.605,
   "end": 15.928
  },
  {
   "text": "Food is fuel, and fuel makes heat.",
   "start": 16.228,
   "end": 18.085
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep bars in an inside pocket so they don't freeze hard.",
   "start": 18.385,
   "end": 21.701
  },
  {
   "text": "Dan reached the top warm.",
   "start": 22.301,
   "end": 23.711
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold hike.",
   "start": 24.311,
   "end": 26.342
  }
 ],
